{"id": "1545674715572600882", "channel_id": "1391701560496623688", "author_id": "1222921860220452895", "author_name": "nekokin0638", "content": "両者母体確保済みの場合\nクレメンタインとムシェットの餅どちらが入手優先でしょうか？", "timestamp": "2026-09-05T05:59:29.440000+00:00"}
{"id": "1545675834902188084", "channel_id": "1391701560496623688", "author_id": "1421799819877290054", "author_name": "yamaiame_ql4", "content": "クレメンタインはイベsrも破格のため替えが効くのでムシェットの方が欲しいかなと思います", "timestamp": "2026-09-05T06:03:56.309000+00:00"}
{"id": "1545680953341513828", "channel_id": "1391701560496623688", "author_id": "1222921860220452895", "author_name": "nekokin0638", "content": "ありがとうございます！", "timestamp": "2026-09-05T06:24:16.640000+00:00"}
{"id": "1545713737674260532", "channel_id": "1391701560496623688", "author_id": "829889228547948554", "author_name": "mocha043308", "content": "初めまして。質問失礼します。\nこの手持ちで銀の鍵はどのキャラを選べばいいでしょうか？", "timestamp": "2026-09-05T08:34:33.034000+00:00", "attachments": [{"id": "1545713736034156595", "filename": "IMG_9182.png", "content_type": "image/png", "size": 3101508, "url": "https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1391701560496623688/1545713736034156595/IMG_9182.png?ex=6a9d2598&is=6a9bd418&hm=104b754c8d6ae3b2cdf1042093b00bd8520ccd77d939fb64d858084798e814b1&"}, {"id": "1545713737326010429", "filename": "IMG_9181.png", "content_type": "image/png", "size": 3138493, "url": "https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1391701560496623688/1545713737326010429/IMG_9181.png?ex=6a9d2598&is=6a9bd418&hm=22dde2bab13f8af95e56973cfb9f35306968ed3139de9ac8fca92145cf577455&"}]}
{"id": "1545714113638965310", "channel_id": "1391701560496623688", "author_id": "516998769888329749", "author_name": "zzzorz", "content": "マーフィーをリセットしていなければマーフィー一択です", "timestamp": "2026-09-05T08:36:02.671000+00:00"}
{"id": "1545715808515264533", "channel_id": "1391701560496623688", "author_id": "829889228547948554", "author_name": "mocha043308", "content": "ありがとうございます！", "timestamp": "2026-09-05T08:42:46.761000+00:00"}
{"id": "1545716215542980659", "channel_id": "1391701560496623688", "author_id": "829889228547948554", "author_name": "mocha043308", "content": "すいません。リセットというのはなんでしょうか？", "timestamp": "2026-09-05T08:44:23.804000+00:00"}
{"id": "1545716757967278150", "channel_id": "1391701560496623688", "author_id": "516998769888329749", "author_name": "zzzorz", "content": "そのキャラをリセットして、凸数などを除去、対応するアイテムに変換することです", "timestamp": "2026-09-05T08:46:33.128000+00:00"}
{"id": "1545716835008253962", "channel_id": "1391701560496623688", "author_id": "516998769888329749", "author_name": "zzzorz", "content": "今回はガチャ不具合のため、期間限定でマーフィーだけその措置が取られています", "timestamp": "2026-09-05T08:46:51.496000+00:00"}
{"id": "1545716911021629501", "channel_id": "1391701560496623688", "author_id": "516998769888329749", "author_name": "zzzorz", "content": "リセットすると、限定キャラなんでも取れるよアイテムにかわります", "timestamp": "2026-09-05T08:47:09.619000+00:00"}
{"id": "1545717020191100980", "channel_id": "1391701560496623688", "author_id": "516998769888329749", "author_name": "zzzorz", "content": "ただし灯火のキャラをまだ設定していない場合には、マーフィーをセットして回してからの方が良いです", "timestamp": "2026-09-05T08:47:35.647000+00:00"}
{"id": "1545717339264258058", "channel_id": "1391701560496623688", "author_id": "829889228547948554", "author_name": "mocha043308", "content": "そうなんですね！\n灯火は設定してしまったので急いでマーフィーと交換して来ます！", "timestamp": "2026-09-05T08:48:51.720000+00:00"}
{"id": "1545717516431654922", "channel_id": "1391701560496623688", "author_id": "829889228547948554", "author_name": "mocha043308", "content": "アドバイスありがとうございます🙇", "timestamp": "2026-09-05T08:49:33.960000+00:00"}
